# About me

I am a computational linguist, research assistant, and doctoral student at the
[Department of Linguistics][] at [Ruhr-Universität Bochum][RUB].  My research
interests include corpus linguistics, (semi-)automatic annotation, processing of
non-standard language varieties, and natural language generation.

I currently work in various research projects related to
[computational historical linguistics][comphist] supervised by
[Stefanie Dipper][].


[Department of Linguistics]: https://www.linguistics.rub.de/
[RUB]: http://www.rub.de/
